# RetinaSense frontend environment.
# Vite dev server proxies /api -> the backend (see vite.config.ts), so in dev
# the browser ONLY talks to localhost:5173 (same-origin) — no CORS, no
# host/IP mismatches. That is why VITE_API_BASE_URL is intentionally EMPTY.
#
# To point the app at an explicit backend URL instead (any browser/host),
# set VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://<host>:8000 and unset the empty line below.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Set VITE_DEMO_MODE=true ONLY to run the clearly-labelled DEMO client, which
# returns SIMULATED data behind a persistent "DEMO MODE | SIMULATED DATA" banner.
# Never enable demo mode for a real screening workflow.
# VITE_DEMO_MODE=false